flowchart LR
  U[Operator or pipeline]

  subgraph APP[Application service network]
    API[Automation API]
    Q[(Job queue)]
    DB[(Results database)]
    API -->|submit job| Q
    API -->|read status| DB
  end

  subgraph BOUNDARY[Controlled dual-homed boundary]
    W[Authorized worker<br/>least privilege and job identity]
  end

  subgraph MGMT[Protected management network]
    FW[Firewall and AAA]
    R1[Network device 1]
    R2[Network device 2]
    C[Controller or platform API]
    FW --> R1
    FW --> R2
    FW --> C
  end

  U -->|HTTPS| API
  Q -->|authorized job only| W
  W -->|structured evidence| DB
  W -->|SSH, NETCONF, RESTCONF, or API| FW
  API -. no direct device route .-> X[Blocked]

